07:49.400 --> 07:49.880
biblique.

07:51.340 --> 07:51.620
Donc,

07:52.720 --> 07:53.640
la grande question

07:53.640 --> 07:54.220
que nous trouvons ici

07:54.220 --> 07:54.960
